    "text": "Women cricketers ke liye naye central contracts ka elaan! 🏏\nGeo News ke mutabiq PCB ne Friday ko 2026-27 season ke liye 8 women cricketers ko central contracts diye hain, jo 30 June 2027 tak lagu rahenge. Category A mein captain Fatima Sana aur Sadia Iqbal, Category B mein Muneeba Ali Siddiqui, Nashra Sundhu aur Sidra Amin, jabke Category C mein Ayesha Zafar, Gull Feroza aur Sadaf Shamas shamil hain. PCB ke mutabiq categories haaliya performance, form aur fitness ki buniyad par banayi gayi hain, aur players ke fitness test baqaidagi se honge.\nAap ki pasandeeda women cricketer kaun hai? Comment mein batayein 👇\n\nImage: AI-generated illustration.\n\n#RiseUpPakistan #PCB #WomensCricket #FatimaSana #PakistanCricket",
